<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania April CPI 0.3 pct mo/mo, 7.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Lithuania April CPI 0.3 pct mo/mo, 7.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian consumer prices rose by 0.3 percent in April month-on-month for year-on-year inflation of 7.3  percent, the statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN CPI		   April 97   March 97   April 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (PCT)  +0.3	 +0.1	 +1.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (PCT)    +7.3	 +8.3	 +31.4</p>
<p>-- Vilnius Newsroom, +370 22 35 17</p>
</text>
